[agent] ## Summary
[agent] Created feature group **`scored26cb88`** (version 1) on the Hopsworks platform with exactly the required columns and online access.
[agent] **What I did — all compute ran platform-side:**
[agent] 1. Ingested the two sources as feature groups: `requests_raw` (key `request_id`) and `profiles_raw` (key `account_id`), both materialized online + offline.
[agent] 2. Computed the on-demand feature **on the platform** via RonDB SQL (`fs.sql(..., online=True)`), which performed the `account_id` join and the arithmetic:
[agent]    - `distance_deg = ROUND(SQRT((req_lat−home_lat)² + (req_lon−home_lon)²), 6)`
[agent]    - `score = ROUND(base_score − 0.1 × distance_deg, 6)` (using the rounded distance)
[agent]    - (The offline `fs.sql`/Hive path is unsupported in SDK ≥4.0, so I used the online RonDB SQL engine.)
[agent] 3. Materialized the 400-row result into `scored26cb88` with `online_enabled=True, stream=True`, primary key `request_id`, and an explicit typed schema.
